+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/5621.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Fix a false positive where custom braces (``{{`` and ``}}``) in ``--msg-template``
+were not recognised and resulted in a warning about an unrecognized argument.
+
+Closes #5621
